OL,3,GNEWSAExpansion work continues at
OL,4,Ahistoric business park
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteel frames for new industrial units
OL,7,Fhave been erected as part of the
OL,8,Fexpansion of a historic business park
OL,9,Fin Loughborough.
OL,11,FFive units are being built at Falcon
OL,12,FPark, also known as the Falcon Works,
OL,13,Fnear the train station, which is home
OL,14,Fto Brush Transformers and other
OL,15,Fbusinesses.
OL,17,FThe first phase - called Falcon Park
OL,18,FNorth - also offers design-and-build
OL,19,Fland of up to 10,219 sq m (110,000 sq
OL,20,Fft).
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
