OL,3,GNEWSAExpansion work continues at
OL,4,Ahistoric business park
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarry Dollin, director of asset
OL,7,Fmanagement at Arax Properties, said:
OL,8,F"After a long, drawn-out planning
OL,9,Fprocess, we're excited to be delivering
OL,10,F#13m of inward investment to
OL,11,FLoughborough and attracting new
OL,12,Fmanufacturing and logistics employers
OL,13,Fto the area."
